{"4188500": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Crawl To The Depths", "steam_appid": 4188500, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Crawl to the Depths is a first-person roguelite where you adventure through destructible caverns. You use the environment to gain an advantage in fast-paced combat, and modify your playstyle by upgrading your equipment on a journey into a forgotten underworld.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4188500/extras/04dcfe6ca21c56870434603c31830652.webp?t=1781219082\" width=446 height=51 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4188500/extras/b721edbb670c19e4ee3c40a19ef37178.poster.avif?t=1781219082\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4188500/extras/b721edbb670c19e4ee3c40a19ef37178.webm?t=1781219082\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4188500/extras/b721edbb670c19e4ee3c40a19ef37178.mp4?t=1781219082\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Encounter strange creatures, criminal gangs, mercenaries and untold horrors in fast paced first-person combat.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore mineshafts, caverns, underground jungles, and bandit hideouts.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Shoot loose rocks to cause cave-ins that crush enemies, anger nests of exploding &quot;gophers&quot;, or shoot unstable crystals that explode into cluster bombs.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4188500/extras/bdcd966b5337bee5835e1cc490149a9f.webp?t=1781219082\" width=446 height=51 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4188500/extras/b04d7d6ae3f112635d8ffec6479ef344.poster.avif?t=1781219082\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4188500/extras/b04d7d6ae3f112635d8ffec6479ef344.webm?t=1781219082\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4188500/extras/b04d7d6ae3f112635d8ffec6479ef344.mp4?t=1781219082\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Carve your own way through the caves by taking advantage of fully destructible terrain, and build bridges and structures to avoid environmental hazards.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mine for ores and gather useful materials scattered throughout the caverns to upgrade your equipment.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4188500/extras/8794fd063e39630c2eb2c6bed902d38a.webp?t=1781219082\" width=446 height=51 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4188500/extras/dfb602f8c27e7e8abf6e7382e6594d04.poster.avif?t=1781219082\" width=800 height=212 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4188500/extras/dfb602f8c27e7e8abf6e7382e6594d04.webm?t=1781219082\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4188500/extras/dfb602f8c27e7e8abf6e7382e6594d04.mp4?t=1781219082\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game features a unique upgrade system where you can combine different materials together to create unique weapon combinations. Add spikes to a bat, craft a deadly steel shotgun, or upgrade your pickaxe to mine harder minerals.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sacrifice gold at altars to unlock magic spells. Whirl your enemies away in a tornado, shoot a barrage of fireballs, or dash yourself out of danger.</p></li></ul>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Crawl to the Depths is a first-person roguelite where you adventure through destructible caverns. You use the environment to gain an advantage in fast-paced combat, and modify your playstyle by upgrading your equipment on a journey into a forgotten underworld.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4188500/extras/04dcfe6ca21c56870434603c31830652.webp?t=1781219082\" width=446 height=51 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4188500/extras/b721edbb670c19e4ee3c40a19ef37178.poster.avif?t=1781219082\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4188500/extras/b721edbb670c19e4ee3c40a19ef37178.webm?t=1781219082\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4188500/extras/b721edbb670c19e4ee3c40a19ef37178.mp4?t=1781219082\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Encounter strange creatures, criminal gangs, mercenaries and untold horrors in fast paced first-person combat.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore mineshafts, caverns, underground jungles, and bandit hideouts.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Shoot loose rocks to cause cave-ins that crush enemies, anger nests of exploding &quot;gophers&quot;, or shoot unstable crystals that explode into cluster bombs.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4188500/extras/bdcd966b5337bee5835e1cc490149a9f.webp?t=1781219082\" width=446 height=51 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4188500/extras/b04d7d6ae3f112635d8ffec6479ef344.poster.avif?t=1781219082\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4188500/extras/b04d7d6ae3f112635d8ffec6479ef344.webm?t=1781219082\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4188500/extras/b04d7d6ae3f112635d8ffec6479ef344.mp4?t=1781219082\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Carve your own way through the caves by taking advantage of fully destructible terrain, and build bridges and structures to avoid environmental hazards.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mine for ores and gather useful materials scattered throughout the caverns to upgrade your equipment.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4188500/extras/8794fd063e39630c2eb2c6bed902d38a.webp?t=1781219082\" width=446 height=51 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4188500/extras/dfb602f8c27e7e8abf6e7382e6594d04.poster.avif?t=1781219082\" width=800 height=212 ><source src=\"https://shared.aka